{"id":"n74725-1-6","stage":5,"title":"전업 · 专业","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74725-1-6-1","ko":"너희 아버지는 직업이 뭐야?","zh":"你们爸爸是做什么工作的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지는","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지는","audio":"/audio/c70c05233681f44d2334.mp3"}},{"text":"직업이","meaning":"职业","explanation":"직업：职业；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"직업","audio":"/audio/c9b556a731fbce64bcd4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83178","senseId":"1","lemma":"직업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직업이","audio":"/audio/4f525e0dc1bce84249cd.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"c9b556a731fbce64","term":"직업","zh":"职业","audio":"/audio/c9b556a731fbce64bcd4.mp3","entryId":"83178","definition":"领报酬而从事的工作。","pronunciation":["지겁"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/44355d54c2b1b728140e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74725-1-6-2","ko":"우리 아버지는 평생 도자기를 만드는 일을 전업으로 삼고 계셔.","zh":"我们爸爸一辈子都专心从事陶瓷制作的工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지는","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지는","audio":"/audio/c70c05233681f44d2334.mp3"}},{"text":"평생","meaning":"平生，一生，终生，终身，一辈子","explanation":"평생：平生，一生，终生，终身，一辈子","readings":[{"term":"평생","audio":"/audio/c783b4a7c2941675b2be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71485","senseId":"1","lemma":"평생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"평생","audio":"/audio/c783b4a7c2941675b2be.mp3"}},{"text":"도자기를","meaning":"陶瓷","explanation":"도자기：陶瓷；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"도자기","audio":"/audio/658619108a06f1b10f47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48126","senseId":"1","lemma":"도자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도자기를","audio":"/audio/434130add0afdbf063b0.mp3"}},{"text":"만드는","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만드는","audio":"/audio/5ace588de32e5a309a75.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일"